{"id":"vod_lz_5058","vodId":"5058","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"终物语","name_cn":"终物语","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220407-1/5445e295e69e6e6a86bcd4cbfbb8e5a7.jpg"},"summary":"《终物语》讲述改编自日本轻小说家西尾维新著作、台湾插画家VOFAN负责插画的轻小说，是《物语系列》终季（Final Season）的第3部，分为上中下三册。《终物语》是物语系列小说第三部分的第二弹作品。其内容包括第完话：扇黑暗（おうぎダーク），讲述了与一种被阿良良木历称为暗/黑暗之影（くらやみ）的怪异有关的故事。 实际上暗根本没有名字。不是怪异，甚至是根本不存在的非存在。卧烟伊豆湖称之为怪异的反存在，世界、命运的修正力本身，追杀偏离了怪异之道的怪异的非存在。看上去是一团漆黑黑洞般，让人联想到黑洞。可将接触到东西的存在完全消失，甚至可以切断历与忍野忍的链。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-04-07 15:21:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220407/5612_9b28281f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220407/5613_3f34aed9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220407/5619_a9a7ceef/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220407/5624_d02d1bef/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220407/5625_244b7de1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220407/5626_48b786e7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220407/5628_f1f6a93a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220407/5629_39274e7e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220407/5630_fc7a0722/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220407/5631_16de16c2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220407/5632_f8847e5f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220407/5633_f7bd203d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220407/5634_37a9405e/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:18:57.860Z"}